select $q$kshana-rajata$q$,$q$KSHANA Rajata$q$,$q$YG-KSH-SL-BR-WS$q$,$q$Silver on warm leather.$q$,$q$A round 40 mm watch with a silver case on a brown leather strap, and a white dial with silver hands.$q$,$q$Rajata is silver, plainly. A white dial and silver hands in a silver case, on brown leather.

